<title>UK: London metro suffers total power blackout.</title>
<headline>London metro suffers total power blackout.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>London's underground train service has suffered what appears to be a total power failure, stranding thousands of passengers in tunnels and stations, television stations said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In a recorded message, London Underground said the system was suffering power problems. The BBC and ITN said the whole system had failed and travellers were being led off trains.</p>
<p>Stations were being closed and travellers said they were being told to find other means of transport.</p>
</text>
